initeFiber.finiteRegionEmbed_norm F F' hFF' A\nimport Lake\nopen Lake DSL\n\npackage \"finiteFiberFormalization\" where\n  -- This package deliberately depends only on public mathlib APIs.\n\nrequire mathlib from git\n  \"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4.git\" @ \"v4.28.0\"\n\n@[default_target]\nlean_lib FiniteFiber where\nrg: tests/FullPauliMultiplicationAxiomAudit.lean: No such file or directory (os error 2)\nFiniteFiber/OneSitePauliNormalForm.lean:14:no compatibility with `FullPauliWord.cocycle` or `FullPauliWord.phaseEmbed`\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:9:finitely supported projective Pauli word.  The multiplication cocycle records\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:33:def phaseEmbed : ZMod 2 →+ ZMod 4 where\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:87:The Pauli multiplication cocycle.  It records the sign\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:90:noncomputable def cocycle (u v : ProjectivePauliWord Site) : ZMod 4 :=\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:91:  phaseEmbed (binaryDot (zCoordinate u) (xCoordinate v))\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:93:/-- The cocycle vanishes with a zero left argument. -/\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:94:theorem cocycle_zero_left (u : ProjectivePauliWord Site) : cocycle 0 u = 0 := by\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:95:  simp [cocycle, binaryDot, zCoordinate]\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:97:/-- The cocycle vanishes with a zero right argument. -/\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:98:theorem cocycle_zero_right (u : ProjectivePauliWord Site) : cocycle u 0 = 0 := by\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:99:  rw [cocycle, xCoordinate.map_zero, binaryDot_zero_right, phaseEmbed.map_zero]\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:101:/-- The Pauli multiplication cocycle satisfies the associative two-cocycle identity. -/\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:102:theorem cocycle_assoc (u v w : ProjectivePauliWord Site) :\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:103:    cocycle u v + cocycle (u + v) w =\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:104:      cocycle v w + cocycle u (v + w) := by\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:105:  rw [cocycle, cocycle, cocycle, cocycle]\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:108:  repeat rw [← phaseEmbed.map_add]\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:123:  ⟨a.phase + b.phase + cocycle a.label b.label, a.label + b.label⟩\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:132:/-- The inverse in normal form, obtained by cancelling the cocycle in `a⁻¹ a`. -/\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:134:  ⟨-a.phase - cocycle (-a.label) a.label, -a.label⟩\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:142:    · change (a.phase + b.phase + cocycle a.label b.label) + c.phase +\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:143:        cocycle (a.label + b.label) c.label =\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:144:        a.phase + (b.phase + c.phase + cocycle b.label c.label) +\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:145:          cocycle a.label (b.label + c.label)\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:147:        (a.phase + b.phase + cocycle a.label b.label) + c.phase +\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:148:            cocycle (a.label + b.label) c.label =\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:150:              (cocycle a.label b.label + cocycle (a.label + b.label) c.label) := by\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:153:              (cocycle b.label c.label + cocycle a.label (b.label + c.label)) := by\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:154:                rw [cocycle_assoc]\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:155:        _ = a.phase + (b.phase + c.phase + cocycle b.label c.label) +\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:156:              cocycle a.label (b.label + c.label) := by\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:162:    · change 0 + a.phase + cocycle 0 a.label = a.phase\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:163:      rw [cocycle_zero_left]\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:169:    · change a.phase + 0 + cocycle a.label 0 = a.phase\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:170:      rw [cocycle_zero_right]\nFiniteFiber/FullPauliLattice.lean:176:    · change